        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a business intelligence assistant. I will provide you with a company name and optionally some basic information. Your task is to enrich the company's profile with relevant details. \n\nFor each company, provide the following fields if possible:\n\n1. Full company name\n2. Industry / sector\n3. Website URL\n4. Headquarters location\n5. Key executives (e.g., CEO, CTO, Head of Marketing)\n6. LinkedIn page URL\n7. Number of employees\n8. Short description of what the company does\n9. Latest news or recent events (e.g., funding, hiring, product launches)\n10. Any other relevant public information\n\nFormat your response as JSON like this:\n\n{\n  \"company_name\": \"\",\n  \"industry\": \"\",\n  \"website\": \"\",\n  \"headquarters\": \"\",\n  \"key_executives\": {\n      \"CEO\": \"\",\n      \"CTO\": \"\",\n      \"Head of Marketing\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"linkedin\": \"\",\n  \"employees\": \"\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"latest_news\": \"\"\n}\n\nCompany to enrich: \"{{ $json.company }}\"\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are a business intelligence assistant. I will provide you with a company name and optionally some basic information. Your task is to enrich the company's profile with relevant details. \n\nFor each company, provide the following fields if possible:\n\n1. Full company name\n2. Industry / sector\n3. Website URL\n4. Headquarters location\n5. Key executives (e.g., CEO, CTO, Head of Marketing)\n6. LinkedIn page URL\n7. Number of employees\n8. Short description of what the company does\n9. Latest news or recent events (e.g., funding, hiring, product launches)\n10. Any other relevant public information\n\nFormat your response as JSON like this:\n\n{\n  \"company_name\": \"\",\n  \"industry\": \"\",\n  \"website\": \"\",\n  \"headquarters\": \"\",\n  \"key_executives\": {\n      \"CEO\": \"\",\n      \"CTO\": \"\",\n      \"Head of Marketing\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"linkedin\": \"\",\n  \"employees\": \"\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"latest_news\": \"\"\n}\n\nCompany to enrich: \"{{ $json.company }}\"\n"
        }
      },
